title: Tang Jiyao Attacks!
subtitle: What the-?
tags: events
view-if: year = 1925 and month = 3 and week = 3
max-visits: 1
priority: 2
new-page: true
face-image: img/portraits/TangJiyao.jpg
on-arrival: {!
Q.yun_casualties = 0;
Q.nra_casualties = 0;
Q.antiyun_casualties = 0;
Q.antiyun_experience = Q.nra_experience + Q.gxc_experience;
Q.antiyun_strength = Q.nra_strength + Q.gxc_strength;
Q.antiyun_militancy = Q.nra_militancy + Q.gxc_militancy;
Q.antiyun_win = 0;
Q.antiyun_lose = 0;
!}

= Tang Jiyao's Attack

Only six days after Sun Yat-sen's death, the warlord of Yunnan, Tang Jiyao has suddenly proclaimed himself the true successor of the Kuomintang! His Yunnanese troops have begun marching south to seize Guangzhou!

- @li: Li Zongren will fight to protect Guangzhou!
- @shen: Shen Hongying must be courted in our favour.
- @lu: Will Lu Rongting fight to protect Guangzhou?

@li
view-if: guangxi_governor = "Li Zongren"
face-image: img/portraits/LiZongren.jpg

Li Zongren, warlord of Guangxi is directly south of Yunnan and is the one province blocking Yunnan from Guangdong. Thus, Tang Jiyao must march through Guangxi to reach Guangzhou.

It seems he will not let Tang Jiyao pass without a fight. Along with NRA troops commanded by Chiang Kai-shek, they have begun the defense of Guangxi.

- @li_battle: The battle begins.

@li_battle
on-arrival: {! Q.antiyun_power = Q.antiyun_strength * Q.antiyun_militancy * (1 + Q.antiyun_experience);
Q.yun_power = Q.yun_strength * Q.yun_militancy * (1 + Q.yun_experience);

Q.antiyun_casualties = (Q.antiyun_strength + Q.yun_strength)
    * (Q.yun_power / (Q.antiyun_power + Q.yun_power)) * 0.1;

Q.yun_casualties = (Q.antiyun_strength + Q.yun_strength)
    * (Q.antiyun_power / (Q.antiyun_power + Q.yun_power)) * 0.1;

Q.antiyun_vstrength = Math.round(Q.antiyun_strength*1000);
Q.yun_vstrength = Math.round(Q.yun_strength*1000);

Q.antiyun_strength -= Q.antiyun_casualties;
Q.yun_strength -= Q.yun_casualties;

Q.antiyun_vcasualties = Math.round(Q.antiyun_casualties*1000);
Q.yun_vcasualties = Math.round(Q.yun_casualties*1000);

if (Q.antiyun_power > Q.yun_power) {
    Q.antiyun_experience += 0.1;
    Q.antiyun_win = 1;
} else {
    Q.yun_experience += 0.1;
    Q.antiyun_lose = 1;
}
!}
go-to: li_yunnanbattlescreen

@li_yunnanbattlescreen

<div>
  <div id="battle_screen">
    <div style="text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <span style="font-size: 24px;">Yunnan-Guangxi War</span>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: center; margin: 20px 30px;">
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="color: #10186e;">Kuomintang and Guangxi Alliance</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Troops</strong><br>
          [+ antiyun_vstrength +]
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ antiyun_vcasualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%; font-size: 20px;">VS</div>
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="color: #723d85;">Yunnanese Army</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Troops</strong><br>
          [+ yun_vstrength +]
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ yun_vcasualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #999; padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="font-size: 14px;">OUTCOME</div>
      [? if antiyun_win = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #66BB6A; margin-top: 5px;">Kuomintang and Guangxi Victory</div> ?]
      [? if antiyun_lose = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #d42f2f; margin-top: 5px;">Yunnanese Victory</div> ?]
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

- @li_winyun: Continue...
- @li_loseyun: Continue...

@li_winyun
view-if: antiyun_win = 1
on-arrival: yun_relation -= 10; gxc_relation += 10;

The **Yunnan-Guangxi** war is still ongoing, but a decisive KMT and Guangxi victory has severely hurt Tang Jiyao's forces in the vast mountains of Guangxi.

Eventually, Tang Jiyao will retreat. This is a victory for now.

@li_loseyun
view-if: antiyun_lose = 1

We are lost. The Yunnanese army has dealt a decisive victory against both NRA and Guangxi forces. Tang Jiyao's army approaches from the north and the road to Guangzhou is free.

Guangzhou has been seized and our leadership is forced into exile.

The Communists and Soviets refuse to help us as Tang Jiyao conquers the rest of Guangdong.

The Guomindang has failed.

- @freeachiev: Congratulations.


@shen
view-if: guangxi_governor = "Shen Hongying"
face-image: img/portraits/ShenHongying.jpg

Shen Hongying is the only obstacle blocking Yunnan for us. His loyalties are also questionable. Will he still support us?

- @bribe: Send a bribe.
- @relations: Use good relations.
- @refuse: Let them come.

@bribe
subtitle: -1 funds
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable_subtitle: Not enough funds.
on-arrival: funds -= 1; gxc_relation += 5;

- @endingshenbribed: The outcome is...

@relations
choose-if: gxc_relation > 20
unavailable_subtitle: Not enough relations.

- @endingshenbribed: The outcome is...

@endingshenbribed
go-to: winshenbribe if gxc_relation > 20; betrayshenbribe

@winshenbribe

Shen Hongying stands with us! Now, Tang Jiyao must fight his forces combined with ours to reach Guangzhou.

- @shen_battle: The battle begins.

@shen_battle
