@self_winyun
view-if: antiyun_win = 1

We have miraculously defeated Tang Jiyao in the battle! This is a major victory for the Guomindang!

@self_loseyun
view-if: antiyun_lose = 1

We have been defeated by Tang Jiyao's Yunnanese forces. Guangzhou has been seized and our leadership is forced into exile.

The Communists and Soviets refuse to help us as Tang Jiyao conquers the rest of Guangdong.

